# Third-party licenses

Minifold is MIT-licensed. Its binary links the Rust crates below (including the C libraries
they bundle: mozjpeg, libwebp, libdeflate, zstd). Each license text is listed once, with the
crates it applies to.

The Docker image also contains programs that Minifold runs as separate processes and does
not link: FFmpeg, Ghostscript, qpdf, libvips, libheif and its plugins, pngquant, gifsicle and
the VA-API drivers. They come from Debian; each one's license is in
`/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright` inside the image, and their source code is available
from Debian (`apt-get source <package>`, or https://sources.debian.org).

